adarkarwastes-by-faemiyah (1.0+git20180525-0ddebs6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches : added 08_load-flac-soundtrack.patch, the intro
    reads the FLAC soundtrack directly with libsndfile
  * debian/*-data.postinst, debian/*-data.prerm : removed, the FLAC file
    is no longer converted back to WAV in /usr/share at install time
  * debian/control : added libsndfile1-dev and pkgconf, cmake (>= 3.16),
    sox moved to Build-Depends-Indep, sox dropped from the data package
    Depends, longer descriptions
  * debian/rules : FLAC compression done in override_dh_install-indep
    only, debian/clean removes the generated file
  * debian/copyright : upstream licence is BSD-3-Clause (LICENCE file)
  * debian/source/lintian-overrides : commented overrides
  * debian/README.Debian, debian/adarkarwastes-by-faemiyah.6.md :
    updated, documented the F and Esc keys

 -- Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:48:55 +0100

